<!-- Duplicates app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_movie.xml (same path data),
     for expediency: Compose Multiplatform resources live in a separate
     module resource tree and can't reference the Android app module's
     res/drawable directly. The android:tint attribute of the original
     is dropped because its @color reference can't resolve here;
     Compose's Icon applies LocalContentColor instead. -->
